  "description": "Conversion of House (Class C3a) into children's care home (Class C2)",
  "epc_number": "0856-3025-6202-1066-9200",
  "ward": "Stanmore",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-18T11:20:56.088Z",
  "street_name": "SITWELL GROVE",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nAptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;Insufficient information\r\nhas been provided in terms of the staffing structure, shift patterns and the\r\nminimum and maximum numbers of staff on site at any one time. Furthermore, the applicant\r\nhas not provided evidence of previous experience of operating children&#x27;s homes.\r\nThe proposal therefore represents an inappropriate change of use, contrary to\r\nthe National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policy H12 of the London Plan\r\n(2021) and Policies GR1 and HO7 of Harrow Local Plan 2021- 2041.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&amp;nbsp;The proposal results in the loss of existing residential floorspace, and no justification or reprovision has been provided to demonstrate that this loss is acceptable. The development would therefore lead to an unwarranted reduction in the borough’s housing stock, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policy H8 of the London Plan (2021) and Strategic Policy 03 Harrow Local Plan 2021 – 2041"
  ],
